1
00:00:00,033 --> 00:00:03,166
Emma what's your favorite subject at school

2
00:00:03,833 --> 00:00:07,266
I love science it's so fascinating

3
00:00:09,566 --> 00:00:12,533
really I find science confusing

4
00:00:13,466 --> 00:00:16,600
I enjoy experiments and learning about nature

5
00:00:17,433 --> 00:00:21,600
I prefer history it's exciting to learn about the past

6
00:00:22,400 --> 00:00:25,466
history all those dates and events

7
00:00:26,166 --> 00:00:28,600
yes it's like time travel

8
00:00:28,800 --> 00:00:32,366
I get bored with history too many old stories

9
00:00:33,233 --> 00:00:36,766
but they're true stories like ancient adventures

10
00:00:37,600 --> 00:00:39,800
I guess that's one way to see it

11
00:00:40,366 --> 00:00:42,700
so what do you like most about science

12
00:00:43,800 --> 00:00:46,866
the mystery discovering new things

13
00:00:47,666 --> 00:00:50,400
I think history has mysteries too

14
00:00:51,066 --> 00:00:54,333
maybe but science has cool experiments

15
00:00:55,200 --> 00:00:59,066
true I just can't handle the formulas

16
00:00:59,800 --> 00:01:02,200
they're not so bad once you get them

17
00:01:02,833 --> 00:01:05,900
I'll stick to my historical battles and stories

18
00:01:06,800 --> 00:01:09,766
and I'll keep exploring the universe in science

19
00:01:10,700 --> 00:01:13,933
let's agree that both subjects can be cool

20
00:01:14,633 --> 00:01:15,666
agreed

21
00:01:16,300 --> 00:01:19,300
maybe I'll pay more attention in history now

22
00:01:19,833 --> 00:01:22,966
and I'll try not to fall asleep in science class

23
00:01:24,000 --> 00:01:26,566
deal let's make school more fun

